# User Uploads, Smoke Tests & Test Gate Images
backend/uploads/*
!backend/uploads/.gitkeep
/uploads/
uploads_smoke/
backend/uploads_smoke/
backend/uploads_comprehensive/
backend/test_gate_images/
backend/scratch_bias_experiment/transformed_images/
reports/contact_sheets/
